== Demographics ==
As of the [[census]]{{GR|2}} of [[2000]], there are 6,139 people, 2,485 households, and 1,615 families residing in the city.  The [[population density]] is 270.3/km&amp;sup2; (700.1/mi&amp;sup2;).  There are 2,797 housing units at an average density of 123.1/km&amp;sup2; (319.0/mi&amp;sup2;).  The racial makeup of the city is 96.63% [[White (U.S. Census)|White]], 1.56% [[African American (U.S. Census)|African American]], 0.26% [[Native American (U.S. Census)|Native American]], 0.18% [[Asian (U.S. Census)|Asian]], 0.02% [[Pacific Islander (U.S. Census)|Pacific Islander]], 0.33% from [[Race (U.S. Census)|other races]], and 1.03% from two or more races.  0.96% of the population are [[Hispanic (U.S. Census)|Hispanic]] or [[Latino (U.S. Census)|Latino]] of any race.

